<view class="page services-page">
  <view class="page-header services-hero fade-enter">
    <view class="eyebrow">Collab Lab</view>
    <view class="title">合作实验室</view>
    <view class="subtitle">把内容、工具、自动化和增长想法，整理成可以真正落地的小项目。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="signal-card section">
    <view class="signal-kicker">适合一起做</view>
    <view class="signal-title">小而准、能复用、结果看得见</view>
    <view class="signal-desc">偏向轻量咨询、自动化搭建、内容系统整理、个人品牌/项目站优化。不追求“堆大词”，更看重是否能帮你省时间、提效率、讲清楚。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">可合作方向</view>
    <view class="service-grid">
      <view class="service-card main">
        <view class="service-index">01</view>
        <view class="service-title">自动化工作流</view>
        <view class="service-desc">把重复动作变成脚本、表格、通知或轻量系统，适合运营、内容、监控和数据整理场景。</view>
        <view class="meta-row">
          <text class="pill type-pill">效率提升</text>
          <text class="pill">脚本</text>
          <text class="pill">流程</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="service-card">
        <view class="service-index coral">02</view>
        <view class="service-title">内容系统整理</view>
        <view class="service-desc">帮个人项目、博客、作品集梳理信息架构、栏目、标签和内容路径。</view>
      </view>

      <view class="service-card mint">
        <view class="service-index mint">03</view>
        <view class="service-title">项目站体验优化</view>
        <view class="service-desc">从首页、文案、视觉层次到转化入口，做一轮轻量但有效的体验改造。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">合作流程</view>
    <view class="flow-list">
      <view class="flow-item"><text>Brief</text><view>先说明目标、现状和你最想解决的一个问题。</view></view>
      <view class="flow-item"><text>Scope</text><view>一起把范围压小，确定交付边界、节奏和优先级。</view></view>
      <view class="flow-item"><text>Build</text><view>快速做出能用的版本，再按反馈迭代细节。</view></view>
      <view class="flow-item"><text>Review</text><view>交付后整理复盘，留下可继续维护的说明。</view></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">边界也说清楚</view>
    <view class="boundary-card">
      <view class="boundary-line yes">适合：目标明确、愿意快速试错、重视长期可维护。</view>
      <view class="boundary-line no">不适合：需求极模糊、只想“一步到位”、完全不接受取舍。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">怎么开始</view>
    <view class="card contact-card">
      <view class="card-title">先从一句话开始</view>
      <view class="card-desc">复制网站或昵称后，把“我想解决什么问题”发过来就行。我们先判断是否适合一起做，再决定下一步。</view>
      <view class="action-row">
        <button class="action-button" bindtap="copySite">复制网站</button>
        <button class="action-button secondary-button" bindtap="copyName">复制昵称</button>
      </view>
      <navigator class="shelf-link" url="/pages/products/products">去数字货架看看模板和资源</navigator>
      <button class="share-line" open-type="share">分享这个合作页</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <bottom-nav selected="-1" />
</view>
